    "text": {
      "en": "Stands at Météo-France's Abbeville-Drucat weather station, just north of Abbeville in the Somme. Its C-band beam covers Picardy, the Somme estuary and the eastern English Channel. The current dual-polarisation radar went into service in 2009."
