    "system": "Selex",
    "band": "C",
    "dualPol": true,
    "since": "2014",
    "towerM": 24,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands at Météo-France's station in Mérignac, on the western edge of Bordeaux. The dual-polarisation C-band radar covers Gironde, the Landes forest and the Atlantic coast. It replaced an older radar in 2014; a radar already operated here in the late 1970s."
    },
