      "en": "Stands at Météo-France's Bourges weather station in the Cher, in the middle of France. Its C-band beam covers the Berry, the Loire valley and the Sologne. Dating from 1987, it is one of the oldest radars still running in the network."
    },
    "photo": null,
    "sources": [
      "https://wrd.mgm.gov.tr/Radar/Detail/V1JEMYx4-8nBjenacvsiHCwBwKIl5wtAiPHdngvfv2yMuCUv",
