    "system": "Selex",
    "band": "S",
    "dualPol": true,
    "since": "2012",
    "towerM": 13,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands at about 640 m in the Massif des Maures above Collobrières in the Var. The S-band radar watches the coast between Toulon and Saint-Tropez and far out over the Mediterranean, where autumn storms bring torrential rain. The current radar dates from 2012."
    },
