    "band": "C",
    "dualPol": true,
    "since": "2011",
    "towerM": 9,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands under a radome at the Grèzes weather station in eastern Dordogne, near the Corrèze border. It covers Périgord, Limousin and the western edge of the Massif Central. The current radar dates from 2011; a radar here was already part of the national network in the early 1980s."
