    "towerM": 13,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands at the highest point of Montancy, at about 930 m in the Jura of the Doubs, right on the Swiss border. It sees deep into Switzerland, Alsace and the Burgundian Gate, and appears on MeteoSwiss maps of the radars around Switzerland. In service since 2007."
