    "band": "C",
    "dualPol": true,
    "since": "1984",
    "towerM": 11,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands in the Lorraine countryside about 30 km east of Nancy. Its C-band beam covers Lorraine, the Vosges and the border areas with Saarland and Alsace. Dating from 1984, it is one of the oldest radars still running in the French network."
    },
