    "since": "2008",
    "towerM": 7,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on the plain south-east of Nîmes, near Manduel in the Gard. The S-band radar watches the Cévennes and the Rhône delta, where autumn storms can bring extreme rain. It replaced an older S-band radar in 2008 and was the first S-band dual-polarisation radar in the network."
