    "towerM": 14,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands in the countryside of northern Finistère near Plabennec, north of Brest. From the western tip of Brittany its C-band beam reaches far over the Atlantic and the western Channel, catching weather systems as they arrive. In service since 2012."
    },
