    "since": "2006",
    "towerM": 29,
    "text": {
      "en": "Sits on top of the observation tower of the Météopôle, Météo-France's research and training campus in western Toulouse, home of the national meteorology school. Its C-band beam covers the Toulouse area, the Garonne valley and the central Pyrenees. In service since 2006."
